# Defra content

Follow the GOV.UK style guide, plus the Defra style guide: <https://digital.defra.gov.uk/content/defra-style-guide>

That guide doesn't cover waste terms. Agree waste terms once with the team (and the regulators, as wording varies between England, Scotland, Wales and Northern Ireland), and record them in `project/regulators-project-context.mdc` rather than inventing phrasing per report.
